  SetupScript:
    code: ""
  Description: |-
    The Score UI Component provides scoring functionality and automatically displays the score in the specified way - either as a head bound 3D object or as a 2D element. It also allows for smooth animations and customization of the score visuals.
    
    API:
    global.score
    - Global property to access the current score value.
    
    script.increaseScore(amount)
    - Increases the score by a set amount. Argument is optional, if left empty increment is 1.
    
    script.decreaseScore(amount)
    - Argument is optional, if left empty decrement is 1.
    
    script.clearScore()
    - Clears the score, and resets it back to the initial score value.
